  "description": "Operating Area: Amalfi Coast, Sardinia, Pontine Islands, Tuscany, Sicily & Aeolian Islands, Liguria & Cinque Terre\n\nLaunched in 2015, the Sanlorenzo SD92 UNICKA is a luxury motor yacht designed to deliver the highest standards of comfort. She is marked by Sanlorenzo’s unmistakable style, based on balance of volumes and effortless maneuverability.\n\nUNICKA comfortably accommodates 10 guests in five elegantly appointed cabins. The spacious full beam master suite is located on the main deck. Additionally, four guest cabins are located on the lower deck: 2 VIP cabins, 1 double cabin and 1 twin cabin. All featuring ensuite facilities.\n\nThe main deck has an elegant salon, often utilized for more formal dining occasions. Guests can indulge in leisurely al fresco dining on the sundeck, which comfortably seats 10 guests. Additionally, the spacious sun deck boasts a bar and a lounge area, perfect for relaxing and socializing in style.\n\nFor moments of privacy or to relish the sensation of the wind in your hair while cruising, the foredeck seating offers the perfect spot to unwind and enjoy the serene surroundings.\n\nThanks to her stabilizers, the yacht offers unparalleled comfort whether at anchor or cruising. With a crew of 4 highly experienced and professional individuals, guests are guaranteed the utmost level of service.\n\nShe is equipped with Starlink high speed internet.",
